  "offensiveAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Feed",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The ghonhatine is adjacent to the corpse of a creature that died within the last hour</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ghonhatine devours a chunk of the corpse. For 1 minute, the ghonhatine gains fast healing 5 and a +2 status bonus to damage rolls. It can gain these benefits from any given corpse only once.</p>\n<p>Effect: Ghonhatine Feed</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Fleshgout",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "disease"
      ],
      "description": "<p>A ghonhatine's vomit carries an awful disease that, over time, can cause a suffering creature's flesh to develop painful boils that eventually slough away, leaving gaping wounds</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 28 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1d4 hours)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Enfeebled 1 and Drained 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> Enfeebled 2 and Drained 2 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> enfeebled 2 and Drained 3 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> Drained 4, enfeebled 2, and Unconscious (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 6</strong> dead</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
